{"ref":"BDB, בָּרָה","hw":"בָּרָה","html":"† I. <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">בָּרָה</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. eat (</strong>Assyrian <em>barû</em> & deriv. Zim<sup>BP 31</sup><strong>) </strong><br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.17\">2 S 12:17</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּרָה</span>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבְרֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.6\">2 S 13:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.10\">10</a> <em>eat bread</em> (<span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרוּ־לָכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.8\">1 S 17:8</a> scribal error for <span dir=\"rtl\">בחדו לכם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.25\">1 K 18:25</a> Dr<sup>Sm 107</sup>).<br><strong>Pi.</strong>  Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְבָרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:10\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.10\">La 4:10</a> <em>for devouring</em>.<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּבְרֵנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.5\">2 S 13:5</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהַבְרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:35\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.35\">2 S 3:35</a> <em>cause to eat bread</em>.","next":"BDB, בִּרְיָה","prev":"BDB, בֶּ֫רֶד"}